Review: Steroid‐eluting sinus stents for improving symptoms in chronic rhinosinusitis patients undergoing functional 
endoscopic sinus surgery
Total studies to screen: 20

SELECTION CRITERIA:
We included all randomised controlled trials (RCTs) comparing steroid‐eluting sinus stents with non‐steroid‐eluting 
sinus stents, nasal packing or no treatment in adult CRS patients undergoing FESS.

INSTRUCTIONS: For each study below, decide INCLUDE or EXCLUDE.
Return exactly one decision object per study; do not omit excluded studies, do not summarize exclusions in bulk, and do 
not return only included studies.
