dressings, glove-coated packing).                                                                                       
                                                                                                                        
- Study 15 (Advance II): The only included study. It is a multicenter, randomized, controlled, double-blind trial using 
an intrapatient control design comparing mometasone furoate-releasing implants vs non-drug-releasing implants in 105    
adult CRS patients undergoing bilateral ethmoidectomy (FESS). This perfectly matches all inclusion criteria."           
                                                                                                                        
