  using an intrapatient control design comparing mometasone furoate-releasing implants vs non-drug-releasing implants   
  in 105 adult CRS patients undergoing bilateral ethmoidectomy (FESS). This perfectly matches all inclusion criteria."  
                                                                                                                        
