│ a randomized, controlled trial", "abstract": "BACKGROUND This study was designed to evaluate the safety and efficacy │
│ of a novel, self-cross-linked hyaluronic acid (HA) hydrogel compared with carboxymethylcellulose (CMC) viscous foam  │
│ in promoting healing when applied after ethmoidectomy. A prospective, randomized, controlled, blinded clinical trial │
│ was performed. The study was performed by four surgeons operating in two community hospitals. METHODS Thirty         │
